{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026020901510916e7e534bb714085","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create the website for Dr Brunno Rodrigues. Based on the progress.md, I've seen 19 different color palettes used. I need to create a completely new, distinctive aesthetic direction that hasn't been used before.\n\n**Aesthetic Direction Thinking:**\n\nLooking at all previous palettes:\n- Warm: rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha, emerald/silk, rose/quartz, amber/bronze, plum/gold, burgundy/gold, rose gold/champagne diamond, coral/seafoam, onyx/bronze patina, moss/burnt sienna\n- Cool: sapphire/champagne, pearl/mink, opal/dusty rose, chrome/violet, amethyst/platinum, teal/copper\n\nI'll create a **Jade Noir & Brushed Gold** aesthetic - inspired by ancient Chinese jade sculpture and luxurious brushed gold accents. This direction feels:\n- Sophisticated and timeless\n- Masculine yet elegant (perfect for Dr Brunno)\n- Completely different from all previous 19 palettes\n- Suggests precision and transformation\n\n**Color Palette:**\n- Jade Noir: Deep jade greens (#2A6B5A, #3A8B7A, #1A4B3A)\n- Brushed Gold: Warm gold with metallic quality (#B89858, #C8A868, #A88048)\n- Rice Paper: Off-white backgrounds (#FAFAF8, #F5F5F2)\n- Ink Black: Deep blacks (#1A1A1A, #0F0F12)\n\n**Typography:**\n- Display: Crimson Pro (elegant serif with modern character)\n- Body: Manrope (geometric sans-serif for readability)\n\n**Border-radius pattern:** Jade stone shapes - organic yet refined with subtle angular qualities"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f120efb9-698b-4e5a-a54e-a533148cc544","uuid":"6e0fc4b3-d40f-422f-8e96-b141b1fa0af1"}
